# Shared by all image builds: Dockerfiles copy the workspace manifests needed
# for a filtered root install (turbo prune is banned because it corrupts
# bun.lock). Keep the build context to tracked-ish sources.
.git
.turbo
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.cache
**/.venv
**/target
**/*.log
.claude
sandbox
packages/docs/*
!packages/docs/wiki
packages/docs/wiki/*
!packages/docs/wiki/package.json
# Heavy assets no image needs: test snapshots (multi-MiB SVG/PNG fixtures) and
# the personal-site blog media (videos/images). Keeps them out of the build
# context AND out of scoped runtime source COPYs (e.g. scout's report package).
**/__snapshots__
packages/sjer.red/src/content
